    "desc": "Displays the timeliness percentage of clean claims and all claims per month per Service Level Agreement. \n•\tPlacing the mouse over this widget will display clean claim timeliness percentage or all claim timeliness percentage per month. \n•\tTo view information for a specific month, select the desired line and month on the widget. The widgets will adjust to reflect information for that specific claim timeliness and month only. Utilizing filter features will only affect that user’s view.\n•\tUsing the scroll filter below this widget will filter down the widget to specific timeframes. Using the scroll filter feature will only affect this widget.\n•\tTo filter all corresponding widgets by grouped selection, left click and drag across the desired information. Click select. All correlating widgets will adjust.\n•\tTo clear the filter from a widget, select clear selection. To restore the work session dashboard and clear any filters, select the options icon located at the top right corner of the dialog. Select Restore Dashboard.",
